---
import DemoLayout from '../../../layouts/DemoLayout.astro';

const tel = '+39 0141 111 111';
const telHref = 'tel:+390141111111';
const email = 'salone-aura@example.com';

const listino = [
  ['Taglio donna', 'da € 28'],
  ['Taglio uomo', '€ 20'],
  ['Piega', 'da € 18'],
  ['Colore', 'da € 45'],
  ['Balayage', 'da € 80'],
  ['Trattamento cheratina', 'da € 50'],
  ['Barba e rifinitura', '€ 15'],
];
---

<DemoLayout
  title="Aura Hair & Beauty · Parrucchiere (demo)"
  description="Demo concept di sito per salone di bellezza: listino, gallery, prenotazioni. Attività fittizia."
>
  <style>
    .au { background: #faf7f2; color: #22201c; font-family: Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif; }
    .au-involucro { inline-size: min(1080px, 100% - 40px); margin-inline: auto; }
    .au-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 26px 0; }
    .au-marchio { font: 500 1.5rem/1 Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
    .au-nav { display: none; gap: 22px; }
    @media (min-width: 860px) { .au-nav { display: flex; } }
    .au-nav a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .au-cta { display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #22201c; color: #22201c; text-decoration: none; padding: 13px 26px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.92rem; }
    .au-cta.solid { background: #22201c; color: #faf7f2; }
    .au-hero { padding: clamp(56px, 10vw, 130px) 0; text-align: center; }
    .au-hero h1 { font: 500 clamp(3rem, 10vw, 7rem)/0.95 Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0; }
    .au-hero p { color: #6f675c; max-inline-size: 44ch; margin: 22px auto 0; line-height: 1.65; }
    .au-hero-riga { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-block-start: 30px; }
    .au-sezione { padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px) 0; }
    .au-centro { text-align: center; max-inline-size: 56ch; margin-inline: auto; }
    .au-centro h2 { font: 500 clamp(1.9rem, 4.5vw, 3rem)/1.05 Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; margin: 0; }
    .au-centro p { color: #6f675c; line-height: 1.65; }
    .au-listino { max-inline-size: 720px; margin: 36px auto 0; }
    .au-listino ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .au-listino li { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 15px 0; border-block-end: 1px solid #ddd3c2; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .au-listino .pr { font-family: Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; white-space: nowrap; }
    .au-sole { display: block; margin: 0 auto 22px; }
    .au-sfondo { position: relative; }
    .au-parola { position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; font: 500 clamp(3.2rem, 10vw, 6.5rem)/1 Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #c9b48f; opacity: 0.6; pointer-events: none; }
    .au-galleria { display: grid; gap: 12px; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; margin-block-start: 36px; }
    @media (min-width: 860px) { .au-galleria { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
    .au-foto { border-radius: 999px 999px 6px 6px; min-block-size: 250px; padding: 18px 16px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; text-align: center; font: 500 0.72rem/1.4 ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .au-team { display: grid; gap: 24px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-block-start: 36px; text-align: center; }
    @media (min-width: 760px) { .au-team { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
    .au-persona h3 { font: 500 1.35rem/1.2 Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; margin: 0; }
    .au-persona p { color: #8a6d3b; font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 8px 0 0; }
    .au-rec { border-block: 1px solid #22201c; padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px) 0; text-align: center; }
    .au-rec blockquote { font: 500 clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 2rem)/1.35 Fraunces, Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; margin: 0 auto; max-inline-size: 30ch; }
    .au-rec cite { display: block; margin-block-start: 16px; font-style: normal; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6f675c; }
    .au-faq { max-inline-size: 720px; margin: 32px auto 0; }
    .au-faq details { border-block-start: 1px solid #ddd3c2; }
    .au-faq summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 15px 0; font-weight: 600; list-style: none; }
    .au-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .au-faq p { margin: 0 0 16px; color: #6f675c; }
    .au-piede { padding: 40px 0 32px; border-block-start: 1px solid #22201c; }
    .au-piede-riga { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 28px; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #6f675c; }
    .au-piede a { color: inherit; }
    .au-contatti { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; align-items: center; margin-block-start: 24px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .au-contatti a { color: inherit; font-weight: 700; }
  </style>

  <div class="au">
    <div class="au-involucro">
      <header class="au-top">
        <a class="au-marchio" href="/demo/parrucchiere">Aura</a>
        <nav class="au-nav" aria-label="Navigazione demo">
          <a href="#listino">Listino</a><a href="#lavori">Lavori</a><a href="#team">Team</a><a href="#contatti">Contatti</a>
        </nav>
        <a class="au-cta solid" href={telHref}>Prenota</a>
      </header>

      <section class="au-hero" aria-labelledby="au-titolo">
        <svg class="au-sole" width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="#8a6d3b" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="12" /><path d="M32 4v8M32 52v8M4 32h8M52 32h8M12 12l6 6M46 46l6-6M52 12l-6 6M18 46l-6 6" /></svg>
        <h1 id="au-titolo">Capelli che<br />parlano di te.</h1>
        <p>Salone di bellezza nel centro storico: taglio sartoriale, colore su misura e un’ora tutta per te. Prima consulenza sempre gratuita.</p>
        <div class="au-hero-riga">
          <a class="au-cta solid" href={telHref}>Prenota un appuntamento</a>
          <a class="au-cta" href="#listino">Vedi il listino</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="au-sezione au-sfondo" id="listino" aria-labelledby="au-listino-t">
        <span class="au-parola" aria-hidden="true">colore</span>
        <div class="au-centro">
          <h2 id="au-listino-t">Listino chiaro, senza sorprese</h2>
          <p>Il prezzo lo concordiamo prima, in base a lunghezza e lavoro. Quello che vedi è quello che paghi.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="au-listino">
          <ul>
            {listino.map(([nome, prezzo]) => (
              <li><span>{nome}</span><span class="pr">{prezzo}</span></li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="au-sezione" id="lavori" aria-labelledby="au-lavori-t" style="padding-block-start:0">
        <div class="au-centro">
          <h2 id="au-lavori-t">Prima e dopo, senza filtri</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="au-galleria" role="list" aria-label="Esempi di lavori">
          <div class="au-foto" role="listitem" style="background:#e4d5bd;color:#5d4a36">Balayage miele</div>
          <div class="au-foto" role="listitem" style="background:#c9b48f;color:#2b2118">Taglio bob</div>
          <div class="au-foto" role="listitem" style="background:#8a6d3b;color:#faf7f2">Colore rame</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="au-sezione" id="team" aria-labelledby="au-team-t" style="padding-block-start:0">
        <div class="au-centro">
          <h2 id="au-team-t">Le mani giuste</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="au-team">
          <div class="au-persona"><h3>Marta</h3><p>Titolare · Taglio</p></div>
          <div class="au-persona"><h3>Sofia</h3><p>Colorista</p></div>
          <div class="au-persona"><h3>Elena</h3><p>Trattamenti · Piega</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="au-rec">
      <div class="au-involucro">
        <blockquote>“Sono entrata con un’idea vaga e sono uscita con i capelli che volevo da anni.”</blockquote>
        <cite>Giulia · recensione dimostrativa</cite>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="au-involucro">
      <section class="au-sezione" aria-labelledby="au-faq-t">
        <div class="au-centro"><h2 id="au-faq-t">Domande frequenti</h2></div>
        <div class="au-faq">
          <details><summary>Devo prenotare o posso passare?</summary><p>La prenotazione è consigliata, specie il sabato. Se passi senza appuntamento ti prendiamo se c’è posto.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Quanto dura un balayage?</summary><p>Da due a tre ore con piega inclusa. Ti offriamo tisana e wifi, promesso.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Fate pacchetti sposa?</summary><p>Sì, con prova acconciatura un mese prima. Chiamaci e costruiamo il pacchetto insieme.</p></details>
        </div>
        <div class="au-centro" id="contatti" style="margin-block-start:40px">
          <h2>Ti aspettiamo</h2>
          <p>Via Cavour 21, 14100 Asti <small>(indirizzo dimostrativo)</small><br />Lun – Sab · 9:00 – 19:00</p>
          <div class="au-contatti">
            <a href={telHref}>{tel}</a>
            <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer class="au-piede">
        <div class="au-piede-riga">
          <span>Aura Hair &amp; Beauty · attività fittizia a scopo dimostrativo</span>
          <span>Demo concept by Trebla Studio · <a href="/demo">Tutte le demo</a></span>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</DemoLayout>
